{"code":"001570","name":"금양","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 1955년 설립된 정밀화학 전문기업으로 1976년 상장되었으며, 해외 10개사를 포함 11개 회사를 보유하고 있음. 발포제는 주력 사업으로 자동차 내장재, 운동화, 단열재 등에 사용되며, 이차전지 사업으로 리튬 이차전지, 수산화리튬 분쇄 가공 사업을 영위하고 있음. 동사는 콩고민주공화국과 몽골에서 리튬 개발을 추진하고, 에스엠랩 인수를 통해 품질경쟁력을 확보하며 친환경 발포제와 수소연료전지 개발에 집중하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":9900.0,"open":9900.0,"high":9900.0,"low":9900.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":9900.0,"ma60":9900.0,"ma120":9900.0,"ma200":9900.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":null,"slope_250":0.0,"r2_250":null,"high52":9900.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":64.2857,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":4.24,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.84,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-79.0,"op_margin_q":-45.4023,"op_qoq":-38.5965,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":41.4815,"rev_yoy":-50.4274,"op_trend_4q":20.5627,"fin_period":"202603","roe":-13.29,"debt_ratio":173.05,"per":null,"pbr":1.41,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":4.24,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"001570","name":"금양","market":"KOSPI","sector_code":"2